#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/programs.html:327
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "资源"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/programs.html:328
msgid ""
"What this programme needs. Nothing is switched on here — a plot using "
"this programme looks at where it sits and reports whether the equipment "
"for each of these is actually there, so you find out before the crop "
"does. Only watering can be found that way today, and only inside a "
"facility: it is matched to irrigation valves placed on the facility plan."
" The others are recorded as intent until there is a way to recognise "
"them."
msgstr "该方案需要什么。这里不会开启任何东西——使用该方案的地块会查看自己所处的位置，并报告这些项目所需的设备是否确实存在，让您比作物更早发现问题。目前只有浇水可以通过这种方式识别，而且仅限设施内：它与设施平面图上放置的灌溉阀门匹配。其他项目仅作为意向记录，直到有办法识别它们为止。"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/programs.html:329
