msgid "View Collected Statistics"
msgstr "查看收集的统计信息"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:150
msgid "Check to opt out of sending anonymous usage statistics."
msgstr "勾选后，退出匿名使用统计的发送。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:159
msgid "AI Service"
msgstr "AI 服务"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:160
msgid ""
"This is an experimental feature. Behavior may change without notice, and "
"availability may be limited or interrupted."
msgstr "这是实验性功能。其行为可能在不另行通知的情况下更改，且可用性可能受限或中断。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:161
msgid ""
"Enable or disable the global AI service. When disabled, the AI menu will "
"be hidden from the navigation bar and AI features will be unavailable. "
"All AI settings and configurations are preserved when the service is "
"disabled."
msgstr "启用或禁用全局 AI 服务。禁用后，导航栏中的 AI 菜单将被隐藏，AI 功能将无法使用。禁用服务不会影响已保存的 AI 设置和配置，它们都将保留。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:162
msgid ""
"Enabling here only makes the AI available. Autonomous operation — "
"periodic summaries, context broadcast and alerts — is started separately "
"on the AI page, after at least one AI model is registered."
msgstr "在此启用只会让AI可用。自主运行——定期摘要、上下文广播和警报——需在至少注册一个AI模型后，在AI页面单独启动。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:171
msgid "Enable AI features and show the AI menu in the navigation bar."
msgstr "启用 AI 功能并在导航栏中显示 AI 菜单。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:183
msgid ""
"Names you typed in yourself — device, zone and crop names — stay in the "
"language you wrote them in. Turn this on to have them shown in the "
"interface language as well. The stored names are never changed. Without "
"an AI engine they are not translated automatically, but translations you "
"enter under Settings > Name Translations are still shown."
msgstr "您自己输入的名称——设备、区域和作物名称——保持您书写时所用的语言。开启后，它们也会以界面语言显示。已存储的名称不会被更改。没有AI引擎时不会自动翻译，但您在“设置 > 名称翻译”下输入的翻译仍会显示。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:195
msgid ""
"Allow external MCP clients (e.g. Claude Desktop) to reach this AoT "
"instance over HTTP. Toggling this takes effect immediately, without "
"restarting anything."
msgstr "允许外部MCP客户端（例如Claude Desktop）通过HTTP访问此AoT实例。切换后立即生效，无需重启任何内容。"

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:200
msgid ""
"This only allows or refuses requests to the external MCP server that is "
"already running. The address and port it listens on are not configured "
"here: for Docker, edit the aot_mcp service's \"ports:\" entry in docker-"
"compose.yml and re-run docker compose up -d; for a native install, edit "
"and restart the aotmcp systemd service."
msgstr ""
"此设置仅决定是否允许对已在运行的外部 MCP 服务器的请求，并不在此处配置该服务器监听的地址和端口：如果是 Docker，请编辑 docker-"
"compose.yml 中 aot_mcp 服务的 \"ports:\" 条目并重新运行 docker compose up "
"-d；如果是原生安装，请编辑并重启 aotmcp systemd 服务。"

