#: outputs/on_off_modbus.py:68
msgid ""
"Switch coils on a Modbus TCP device (PLC, relay board, gateway). Each "
"channel is one coil address. After every command the coil is read back to"
" confirm it actually changed, and a mismatch is reported as a failure. "
"Inputs and Outputs pointing at the same host and port share one "
"connection automatically. Note that a readback confirms the PLC register,"
" not that the relay or wiring moved. Modbus has no authentication or "
"encryption — keep the device on an isolated network."
msgstr "控制Modbus TCP设备（PLC、继电器板、网关）上的线圈。每个通道对应一个线圈地址。每次发送命令后都会回读线圈，确认其确实发生了变化，不一致则报告为失败。指向同一主机和端口的输入与输出会自动共用一个连接。请注意，回读确认的只是PLC寄存器，并不代表继电器或接线确实动作。Modbus没有身份验证和加密，请将设备置于隔离网络中。"

#: outputs/on_off_modbus.py:98
