msgid "Prevent Label Collision"
msgstr "防止标签重叠"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:770
msgid "Automatically hide overlapping labels when enabled."
msgstr "启用后自动隐藏相互重叠的标签。"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:777
msgid "Label Text Size"
msgstr "标签文字大小"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:778
msgid "Specify the size of all map labels (unit: em)."
msgstr "指定所有地图标签的大小(单位:em)。"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:789
msgid "Hide Labels When Zoomed Out — L1"
msgstr "缩小时隐藏标签（L1）"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:791
msgid ""
"Below this zoom level, output / input / function / equipment / sensor / "
"plot / bay / note labels and value keys are hidden. Site labels always "
"stay visible so the map keeps its bearings. Zone and facility labels have"
" their own threshold below (L2). Set 0 to never hide."
msgstr "缩放级别低于此值时，将隐藏输出 / 输入 / 功能 / 装置 / 传感器 / 地块 / 栋 / 笔记的标签以及数值键。站点标签始终显示，以便地图保持方位感。区域和设施标签在下方（L2）有各自独立的阈值。设为0则永不隐藏。"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:808
msgid "Hide Labels & Shapes When Zoomed Out — L2"
msgstr "缩小时隐藏标签和形状（L2）"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:810
msgid ""
"A second, independent zoom threshold — currently for zone/facility labels"
" and zone/plot/equipment shapes. They need to stay visible at a wider "
"zoom than L1 above, so they get their own value here. More label and "
"shape kinds may be added to this tier later. Set 0 to never hide."
msgstr "第二个独立的缩放阈值，目前用于区域/设施标签以及区域/地块/装置形状。它们需要在比上方L1更大的缩放范围内保持可见，因此在此单独设值。今后可能会有更多标签和形状类型加入此级别。设为0则永不隐藏。"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:823
msgid "Facility-centric Labels"
msgstr "以设施为中心的标签"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:825
msgid ""
"Off (default): outdoor-centric — site/zone labels stay visible at all "
"zoom levels; facility and sensor labels appear only when zoomed in. On: "
"facility-centric — facility and sensor labels take priority; site/zone "
"labels yield and merge when zoomed out."
msgstr "关闭(默认):以室外为中心——场地/区域标签在所有缩放级别下始终可见,设施和传感器标签仅在放大时显示。开启:以设施为中心——设施和传感器标签优先显示,缩小时场地/区域标签让位并合并。"

#: widgets/AoT_map.py:840
