msgid ""
"Proactively shift temperature/humidity setpoints and inhibit ventilation "
"before adverse weather arrives. Uses this facility's own forecast source "
"if one is linked in the facility editor's weather bindings (any service —"
" KMA, OpenWeatherMap, Open-Meteo); otherwise falls back to the system-"
"wide KMA short-term forecast."
msgstr ""
"在恶劣天气到来之前主动调整温度/湿度设定点并抑制通风。如果在设施编辑器的天气绑定中为该设施关联了自己的预报源（任意服务均可——KMA、OpenWeatherMap"
"、Open-Meteo），则使用该来源；否则将回退到系统级的气象厅（KMA）短期预报。"

msgid ""
"How many hours ahead to check for incoming adverse weather (1–6 h) when "
"using the system-wide KMA fallback above. Longer lookahead gives earlier "
"warning but may over-correct. Ignored when this facility has its own "
"forecast source linked — that source already applies its own lookahead."
msgstr ""
"在使用上方系统级 KMA 备用预报时，提前多少小时检查即将到来的恶劣天气（1–6 "
"小时）。前瞻时间越长，预警越早，但也可能导致过度调节。如果该设施已关联自己的预报源，则忽略此设置——该来源已应用其自身的前瞻时间。"

