msgid "Current readings against the targets and limits this stage declares — the same card the map widget shows, including DLI and accumulated heat. [7 Days] turns each row into the range it moved through over the last week."
msgstr "当前读数与本阶段声明的目标和限值的对比，即地图Widget所显示的同一张卡片，包括DLI和积温。点击[7天]会把每一行变为其过去一周内变动的范围。"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py
msgid "Fills the rows that have no range of their own (CO2, soil moisture, dew point) with a recent trend line. Needs the targets block."
msgstr "为没有自身范围的行（CO2、土壤水分、露点）补充近期趋势线。需要目标区块。"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py
msgid "How far this stage has come towards the next one in growing degree days. Shown only when the programme moves stages by GDD. The running total since planting is a row in the environment card instead, and follows that card's settings."
msgstr "本阶段以生长度日计，距离下一阶段还有多远。仅当程序按GDD切换阶段时显示。自栽种以来的累计值则是环境卡片中的一行，并遵循该卡片的设置。"

